{"2266750": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "LightSup!", "steam_appid": 2266750, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/2abdf7805364a01da24c673d8a35e0b0.avif?t=1788151128\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LightSup! </strong>is a chaotic<strong> 1–4 player couch co-op adventure</strong> set in a vibrant world plunged into darkness by a mysterious eclipse. Take on quests, battle dangerous monsters, and reignite the <strong>Altar of Light</strong>, an artifact that preserves your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful <strong>Blessings</strong> that strengthen your team, but stay too long… and the <strong>Nightmare</strong> grows stronger, bringing deadly <strong>Curses</strong>. Upgrade your characters, unlock new weapons, and work together to uncover the truth behind the eclipse and save the Lumineia Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight together. Stay in the light. Or fall into darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC CO-OP ADVENTURE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.webm?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.mp4?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with up to 4 players in fast, frantic co-op battles.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure throws your party into randomized encounters as you fight through monster swarms and unleash wild skills against threats emerging from the darkness. <strong>LightSup!</strong> is built for laughter, shouting, and pure co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT UP THE ALTAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/22af99b051d7ced6cdf5488ad3085baa.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/22af99b051d7ced6cdf5488ad3085baa.webm?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/22af99b051d7ced6cdf5488ad3085baa.mp4?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pray to the Altar of Light, your team's lifeline.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay within its glow to preserve your sanity and gain <strong>Virtue</strong>, a strength buff granted to those who fight in the light. Step into the darkness, and your sanity drains, inflicting <strong>Fear</strong>, a debuff that weakens your party and deals damage over time. Protect the light, stay together, and push back the enemies threatening the Lumineia Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SCRAMBLE TO SURVIVE, FACE FEARSOME MONSTERS</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/4a13b14b6e322e014d9aced1b7d67517.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/4a13b14b6e322e014d9aced1b7d67517.webm?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/4a13b14b6e322e014d9aced1b7d67517.mp4?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle a wide variety of monsters while scrambling to stay together.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive overwhelming hordes, uncover hidden mysteries, and challenge powerful bosses and mini-bosses on your journey to restore the once-peaceful kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BRANCH YOUR PATH. SHAPE YOUR ADVENTURE.</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/860c4d3c2e29143b9c4b05744b781c01.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/860c4d3c2e29143b9c4b05744b781c01.webm?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/860c4d3c2e29143b9c4b05744b781c01.mp4?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every decision shapes your chances of survival.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your journey branches in unexpected ways, and the whole party shares the consequences. When presented with powerful <strong>Blessings</strong>, choose one together to empower your team. When faced with twisted <strong>Curses</strong> born from the eclipse's Nightmare, choose one together to endure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/1ece2b95912efa4c9e9325f5d237dead.avif?t=1788151128\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight a Chaotic Battle:</strong> Grab your friends and save the kingdom from endless hordes of enemies as a novice adventurer party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Path:</strong> After each room, decide where to go next: Blessings, stat boosts, or special upgrade rooms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Maintain Sanity: </strong>Use the Altar of Light to illuminate the eternal night, boosting your combat power and helping you overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Blessings &amp; Curses: </strong>Collect team-wide positive or negative perks that will make each adventure a unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Adapt your playstyle with randomized paths that lead to unexpected encounters and help you find new weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Unlock Unique Traits:</strong> Discover different play styles through characters with special traits and abilities. Try various ways to upgrade your playable characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER - REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally with up to 4 players using keyboards and controllers. Or use Steam Remote Play Together to experience the chaos with friends online. Surviving the darkness is always better together.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LightSup! </strong>is a chaotic<strong> 1–4 player couch co-op adventure</strong> set in a vibrant world plunged into darkness by a mysterious eclipse. Take on quests, battle dangerous monsters, and reignite the <strong>Altar of Light</strong>, an artifact that preserves your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover powerful <strong>Blessings</strong> that strengthen your team, but stay too long… and the <strong>Nightmare</strong> grows stronger, bringing deadly <strong>Curses</strong>. Upgrade your characters, unlock new weapons, and work together to uncover the truth behind the eclipse and save the Lumineia Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight together. Stay in the light. Or fall into darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAOTIC CO-OP ADVENTURE</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.webm?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/d0443d70e8373a9e975358a68ed9a1e3.mp4?t=1788151128\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team up with up to 4 players in fast, frantic co-op battles.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure throws your party into randomized encounters as you fight through monster swarms and unleash wild skills against threats emerging from the darkness. <strong>LightSup!</strong> is built for laughter, shouting, and pure co-op chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIGHT UP THE ALTAR</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/extras/22af99b051d7ced6cdf5488ad3085baa.poster.avif?t=1788151128\" width=560 heig