ng you overcome challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shared Blessings &amp; Curses: </strong>Collect team-wide positive or negative perks that will make each adventure a unique journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite Progression:</strong> Adapt your playstyle with randomized paths that lead to unexpected encounters and help you find new weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade &amp; Unlock Unique Traits:</strong> Discover different play styles through characters with special traits and abilities. Try various ways to upgrade your playable characters.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIPLAYER - REMOTE PLAY TOGETHER:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play locally with up to 4 players using keyboards and controllers. Or use Steam Remote Play Together to experience the chaos with friends online. Surviving the darkness is always better together.</p>", "short_description": "LightSup is a chaotic 1–4 player couch co-op adventure where darkness drains sanity while the Altar of Light keeps you alive. Battle monsters, gain powerful Blessings, endure dangerous Curses, and choose your path to save the world from an eternal eclipse.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/3da7db887cd1317078767e5cdff03b1bd6f46cbf/header.jpg?t=1788151128", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/0835f7f423f14bf510874822d85fc9c275f4bd52/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788151128", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2266750/0835f7f423f14bf510874822d85fc9c275f4bd52/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788151128", "website": "https://www.bugbliostudio.com/LightSup", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:<